f41bdc2220d3b1606f7116b456a1ec5d96a9c8d09c5a7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fee3db89e6e160b75cb2aac5e85a427361e9ef6881ad1f06c225218bfaa37dcb","logical_entry_identity":"758f0ca496047645874298e1fa2acefe9ba6a6b4972d1ccf4f5716d551225b8b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Humans are one of the main races on Maj'Eyal, along with the Halflings. For many thousands of years they fought each other until events, and great people, unified all the Human and Halfling nations under one rule.","source_tag":"_t","target":"人类与半身人一起是马基·埃亚尔的主要种族，他们曾互相争战了几千年，直到历史的洪流与伟大的领袖将所有人类和半身人的国度统一在同一面旗帜之下。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"185664b2ff9e3e3765519a0b8bffc771ff58711898cff161afca43f6dba2f39d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fee8304bce3af592d35e9ea835b7a5d2e1d9db781b4a8cd669901f45f2df48ea","logical_entry_identity":"bd84a901e3edf9c64239f8233e271d090f9fb434a8f1f18802f00ef3a2532ee3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"create a reflective shield (50%% reflection rate, %d strength, based on Magic) for %d turns","source_tag":"tformat","target":"制造反射护盾（50%%反射率，%d吸收量，基于魔法）持续%d回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"451e156509bf610f2a64252d21dc4b888ba0515b1ff48327286cbcdb420b0b06","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fee9b52c48fcc8944e89ba5be1bf61556ee1530a872cd331afc254fde3f2990f","logical_entry_identity":"11564528f73850ce016c9b0e13fce43333260d7a6b8e3f55ec845f1b007b24f7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"brawler's ","source_tag":"entity name","target":"格斗家的"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2c2ccffad755a1a4f590a3274a634844e930084e1c2dc3889cf3dc5fe2b06126","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"feeb8fceec9485945fe1c749417a987ca5b8d8edb6d60b3bfac2ec95b3e51f2b","logical_entry_identity":"a136b7cf974039072d0763d8eb2f76b4d4d60dc55a0cf3bea13a12d0530f0605","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Any time one of your skeleton or bone giant dies, it shatters in radius %d, making any foe bleed for %0.2f physical damage over 5 turns.\n\t\tIf any other skeleton or bone giant minion is in the radius it will pickup some of the bones to enhance itself, increasing maximum and current life by %d, armour by %d and gain %0.2f physical melee retaliation for 20 turns.\n\t\tThis talent never works when you kill your own minions.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"每当你的骷髅或骨巨人死去时，它会在半径 %d 码范围内粉碎，使敌人在5回合内受到 %0.2f 物理流血伤害。\n\t\t如果范围内有其他骷髅或骨巨人，它们会使用这些骸骨强化自己，增加最大和当前生命值 %d，护甲值 %d，并获得 %0.2f 物理近战报复效果，持续 20 回合。\n\t\t如果你杀死自己的随从，这一效果不会触发。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e33a0f9b5d1eba82b8e5d755a32c35e93d6d4954805a99e8a8eca2592c117448","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"feed956b2efd4e75b7984c455380911acaddda6d2a86b31123c9284385dc7ddf","logical_entry_identity":"25d32e48cbc2dc7e4bdc3b78e2e8e795f0e4f4bc9b8268a3f1d80cbc1ff7a99e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*After a glorious battle, the Master falls!*\nHah...haha. You did it, @playerdescriptor.race@...\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*The master of the arena, defeated, stands up with a wide smile.\n#LIGHT_GREEN#Feeling the master's approval, you pick up its weapon, now lying\n#LIGHT_GREEN#in the blood-stained sand.*\nEveryone! We got a champion today!!\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*The audience rages and shouts your name repeatedly*\nCongratulations, @playerdescriptor.race@. You are the Master now.\nNow you shall take your rightful place as the champion.\nJust remember...like me, you shall fall one day...\nBut meanwhile, this is your place! Welcome to paradise, @playerdescriptor.race@!\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*You see several sponsors and military recruiters approach the\n#LIGHT_GREEN#now defeated master, offering deals and good positions in the army.\n#LIGHT_GREEN#You smile, victorious, knowing your life will be glorious from now on.\n#LIGHT_GREEN#Because even if you are defeated in the future...\n#LIGHT_GREEN#You can always sell your image and live large.\n\n#YELLOW#CONGRATULATIONS!\n#YELLOW#You are the new master of the arena! You are great and epic!\n#YELLOW#You shall remain as the new master until someone challenges you!\n#YELLOW#Next time you play, you shall battle this new champion instead!\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*一场辉煌的战斗过后，竞技场主宰倒下了！*\n哈……哈哈。你做到了，@playerdescriptor.race@……\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*战败的竞技场主宰站起身，脸上挂着灿烂的笑容。\n#LIGHT_GREEN#感受到他的认可，你拾起了他的武器——\n#LIGHT_GREEN#它正落在染血的沙地上。*\n各位！我们今天迎来了一位冠军！！\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*观众沸腾起来，一遍遍高喊你的名字*\n恭喜你，@playerdescriptor.race@。如今你才是竞技场主宰。\n现在，你将登上冠军应得的位置。\n只要记住……和我一样，你终有一天也会倒下……\n但在那之前，这里属于你！欢迎来到天堂，@playerdescriptor.race@！\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*你看到几名赞助人和军方招募者走向落败的前任主宰，\n#LIGHT_GREEN#向他提出合作条件，并许诺军中的优厚职位。\n#LIGHT_GREEN#你以胜利者的姿态微笑着，知道自己此后的人生必将辉煌。\n#LIGHT_GREEN#因为即使你将来落败……\n#LIGHT_GREEN#也总能靠自己的名气赚得盆满钵满。\n\n#YELLOW#恭喜！\n#YELLOW#你是新的竞技场主宰！伟大而传奇！\n#YELLOW#在有人前来挑战之前，你将一直担任新的竞技场主宰！\n#YELLOW#下次游玩时，你将与这位新冠军交战！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3916a3989cbadf286272b84b494643056bdff1b4426e0bbce7de3f479d1ddcd8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"feee4ce2be4c21eb6a528143905e7098ec39f0bb1897a8fdd84554a93f9f41d9","logical_entry_identity":"795b6e320d6ab5dbc540b8ec4a4e8ae25755fdcfcaee7a84e926b6d04a738520","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"hours","source_tag":"_t","target":"小时"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4582f6a223a3124832864e87dbeec296e4fc244ea8d51de258645555cb0577a7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fef5342d25ee1db3c96adcb04f34636346298dce83f2676828854eef336c9125","logical_entry_identity":"6164f27d06b4c24db42ecd85aedca4cef9e0a3eb0b6f5c110b2f22414b657007","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Combination Kick","source_tag":"talent name","target":"组合踢"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ac50a8e0fa2d45cb68c0c006d538996b80d20e3a6c7c39a4a040cf7d8af9b921","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fef7e35ded731b291e86142958f652fa8888390173d80aed1c718521693112e1","logical_entry_identity":"f44f420f6167d9dbbe541010b43dcb5a0f4572a9d8755c0f4bc86d458231dfc4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"grows dramatically in power","source_tag":"_t","target":"大幅增加强度"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"11fd8871d56dfda18112dbb92d2f5562b87f0e05ac9d6b830f3a6042278a61c8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fefee0dab317f6f8e7080d72dfa2d344a4d8cc8b43a38b80cfc381b15379b47d","logical_entry_identity":"c3f0f571a50ad51aa79b0da5c0ca02de760012ab8a56352019afe934c2505625","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"healing","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"治疗"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ee038ac0b68b56738378a458f5c33217d6a0d1e09a6d483f1a2e554e5c0060c6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"feff9455056f52605f6408d39f534f2c2628d9ae6cf8ce0d6580c32017429d89","logical_entry_identity":"15d7c6944068601bd3785ead3f09db5fe13ab84657244982dab00809cdfde7d4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Enables mouse targeting. If disabled mouse movements will not change the target when casting a spell or using a talent.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"开启鼠标指定目标功能。如果关闭，技能指定目标时不受鼠标移动影响。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"09fe36333379ca6850f54f45cdea51b659f004936a417cc587ddfebf2c10bb42","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff084e54304a7fde58908b7939a7bbbb5b5612d9236bb7cf46e1f2d6382c7fdc","logical_entry_identity":"2a0b4577045bf1f0a1bca13ff9c4307dcd312ea6a40cc8aeef1a2fd3d4a6ae07","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"When you kill an enemy, their death forms a cursed magical pattern on the ground. This creates a circle of radius %d which blinds enemies and deals them %0.2f light damage, while giving you %d positive energy per turn. The circle lasts for %d turns.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe duration of the circle can be increased by a critical hit.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe blind chance increases with your Spellpower.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYou can activate this talent to draw the pattern in your own blood, creating it underneath you at the cost of %d%% of your maximum life.\n","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当你杀死敌人时，死亡会在地面上形成一个魔法咒印。产生一个半径 %d 的法阵，会致盲敌人并造成 %0.2f 光系伤害，同时每回合给予你 %d 正能量。法阵持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t持续时间可以暴击。\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t致盲概率受法术强度加成。\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t你可以主动使用这一技能，支付 %d%% 最大生命，用自己的鲜血在脚下绘制咒印。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c49e08359f4ca08513c9770413266ca09dece67d69ebff2e3569e5871b1813af","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff094eda1c2d0d40d6285f10cd7641c78170dd70de13ed9f7e1518876a06b76a","logical_entry_identity":"4a2a5ea63b68c2dc81adf7be6aa1387401a3345ca330e6ac5b1827cd4f78b73b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"voracity","source_tag":"talent type","target":"贪婪"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"665a92b151c517181678913a1e0aaccdd656aff51973bd48bc3fe9a62b187eb3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff1496f6b33c53bcf6ee2e3b86da96c8f23c3e240ac62213e7ce0a41314984e3","logical_entry_identity":"f98eaa4dc0f68c9220c2488fa1ea4120e404b3b94d40fc0f2f524503da2a60e4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"All healing for the player increased by 10%","source_tag":"_t","target":"玩家受到的所有治疗效果增加 10%"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b280327ec02318a183ebc2747a5305ec1ca8e7cee1fcb3625677fe9311c1e673","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff16477ad45a907a4dd3a939767f7ea7f6e241b0e47d0f198ca8b8950413fb95","logical_entry_identity":"bb4eae900066337582832207bc8f554bc7da53fe718f6c3b9b11e7496ad01120","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Thought-Form: Warrior","source_tag":"talent name","target":"思维形态：战士"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1b7b09bb120209f5bda3f3a89b28a99ee05dc985044fb4200cb5d51e2f4c839d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff17495900989d5c027ede5c4f20e512daec0494f4c71aef72db906d07a34e9d","logical_entry_identity":"9ce3134815f20588c74f5808e1e82b2f834ef3fc40b85d4a0ed6a9e0ab1b11d1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ben Cruthdar, the Abomination","source_tag":"entity name","target":"本·克鲁塞达尔，憎恶形态"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7f983326cd79a861dfa61a355bcca9a06aac4aa296cb909986d659c206abebc2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff1faeef69fb59d9cf3d5fca6afde6a5dbdf31b2ce53b49ecee46aad04c923a9","logical_entry_identity":"d53710c967d3d0ef95422437968ffa5eafca0492e7304e0f1af635a8dda4a28a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#SALMON#Resolver selected:#LAST# ","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#SALMON#选定的解析器：#LAST# "},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"66372d4b1634d6a7b99a167f8009cd37b5450fcf200257afd453d578b7a55386","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff21726e0bbffa54a6faec54c5978e4cfa13b00ad24762a066c6271c43e27609","logical_entry_identity":"41732f31e3666ad67d1be8e83901f8795b7eff1b27aaabd8cee570e699e23f03","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"grey mold","source_tag":"entity name","target":"灰色霉菌"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"07ff5193b09c02af333ae577f985ab5582e5809b29dfd7d925055190c5703c5b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff2ab28568042c567e8fb4c8d4217001be90fe72361ea7a56e885d25bdf31434","logical_entry_identity":"11431645f669217b3d43fcb2005c0ac05232ad91a881bca7d68aab1bf849b171","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Saves#LAST#\nSaving throws represent your ability to shrug off, partially or fully, detrimental effects applied to you.  Most detrimental effects will check their power (physical, spell, mental) vs your corresponding save type to determine if they take effect or not.  The chance is usually ~50% when power and save are equal.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#豁免#LAST#\n豁免代表你部分或完全摆脱异常状态的能力。大部分异常状态会将攻击者的（物理，法术，精神）强度和你对应的豁免类型进行对抗，来决定是否造成了异常状态。当强度和豁免值相等的时候，几率大约为50%。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b807e671db23ac06d395ab91b2efb591004806b373f72d0b9803e46aea74aa78","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff3393eed89aa399e6565c7e0b9b3b9148eaa88e90fca3c3a08636db6d9d5143","logical_entry_identity":"718160c6cf49950318fc1dba8214c1b3d913659a8abfc8cf5ae5e4bfe30f6b11","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Halfling armies have brought many kingdoms to their knees and they kept a balance of power with the Human king